WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.063 --> 00:00:04.557
Wow!

2
00:00:05.156 --> 00:00:07.221
Who are you?

3
00:00:08.067 --> 00:00:11.128
I'm a Komodo dragon.

4
00:00:12.671 --> 00:00:14.833
We are lizards.

5
00:00:17.912 --> 00:00:20.342
You're really big!

6
00:00:21.986 --> 00:00:25.232
We can grow up to three meters long.

7
00:00:26.093 --> 00:00:30.488
We can weigh over 140 kilograms.

8
00:00:32.264 --> 00:00:35.690
We're the biggest lizards in the world.

9
00:00:37.486 --> 00:00:39.589
Where do you live?

10
00:00:40.463 --> 00:00:44.507
We live on islands in Indonesia.

11
00:00:45.143 --> 00:00:49.984
The islands have forests, beaches, and grasslands.

12
00:00:51.277 --> 00:00:55.529
We like to stay in the forest and grasslands.

13
00:00:56.815 --> 00:00:58.928
What do you eat?

14
00:01:00.061 --> 00:01:03.061
We eat almost anything.

15
00:01:05.145 --> 00:01:09.012
Snakes and birds are tasty meals for us.

16
00:01:10.297 --> 00:01:15.084
We also like goats, monkeys, deer, and pigs.

17
00:01:16.953 --> 00:01:20.424
Huh? How can you eat a big deer?

18
00:01:21.233 --> 00:01:25.299
We can open our jaws really wide.

19
00:01:27.571 --> 00:01:30.830
Plus our teeth are sharp.

20
00:01:33.397 --> 00:01:35.825
How do you catch your meals?

21
00:01:36.577 --> 00:01:39.699
Komodo dragons are good at hiding.

22
00:01:41.184 --> 00:01:45.216
We hide and wait for animals to pass.

23
00:01:45.489 --> 00:01:47.749
Then we attack.

24
00:01:49.834 --> 00:01:52.529
You look like a dragon!

25
00:01:53.545 --> 00:01:59.629
Our tongues are shaped like forks.

26
00:02:00.075 --> 00:02:03.224
And they are yellow, like fire.

27
00:02:04.732 --> 00:02:06.793
It's hot.

28
00:02:08.089 --> 00:02:11.131
I'm going to nap in the shade.

29
00:02:13.795 --> 00:02:17.135
Good-bye, Komodo dragon!

